Each model call ends with one tool request or the final answer. The model can only write a request; it cannot run a tool, so after each request the program runs it and calls the model again. Counting that as one call is an easy slip. Here:
- call 1: request check_calendar; program runs it;
- call 2: request search_manuals; program runs it;
- call 3: request check_training_record; program runs it;
- call 4: final answer.
